OL,3,GNEWSACity plagued by people 'drunk all
OL,4,Aday long' and fights
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew measures are being rolled out in a
OL,7,Fcity centre plagued by people "drunk
OL,8,Fall day long", street fighting and
OL,9,Fshoplifting.
OL,11,FGloucestershire Police has stepped up
OL,12,Faction to tackle anti-social behaviour
OL,13,Fin Gloucester, including increasing
OL,14,Fstreet patrols and confiscating
OL,15,Falcohol.
OL,17,FInsp James O'Neill said the area has
OL,18,Fhad "persistent problems with
OL,19,Fanti-social behaviour" and that there
OL,20,Fis a clear need to deal with the
OL,21,Fproblem.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
