OL,3,GNEWSACity plagued by people 'drunk all
OL,4,Aday long' and fights
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident Lisa Hampter described seeing
OL,7,Fpeople "drunk all day long, fighting on
OL,8,Fthe streets and stealing", adding:
OL,9,F"You've only got to look out your
OL,10,Fwindow and there's some kind of
OL,11,Fanti-social behaviour going on."
